Story: Flying a VTOL
  As a pilot
  I want to take off straight up, fly forward on the wing, hover again and land straight down
  So that I can fly a long way from a small place

  This tutorial shows a full VTOL flight. You take off straight up, and the plane hovers
  over the field. You switch to forward flight, and the plane tilts its wing motors forward
  and flies on its wing. Then you switch back to a hover, and you land straight down. The
  plane keeps its height through both transitions.

  Scenario: Take off, fly forward, hover, land
    When the operator arms the vehicle
    Then the vehicle is armed
    When the operator takes off vertically
    Then the flight is hovering
    When the operator switches to forward flight
    Then the flight is cruising
    When the operator switches to hover
    Then the flight is hovering
    When the operator lands vertically
    Then the plane is on the ground
    And the vehicle is disarmed
